int idxFirst (vector&lt;int&gt; arr, int q) {
    for (int i = 0; i &lt; arr.size(); i++)
        if (arr[i] == q)
            return i;
    return -1;
}
How long does it take?

The blank is filled in now, with a name the room earned – worth a beat. “Find” was never enough: a function called find could return a bool, a value or an iterator. A precise description hands you idxFirst almost for free.
Take answers. Somebody will say “it depends” – that is the slide after this.
